      "seed": 1150386585,
      "version": 1873,
      "versionNonce": 1886351449,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1779354403457,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1) SideQuest - Log your Lore\n\n> Released 15 March, '26\n> Intake on an invite basis (sign up and you are in the queue)\n> Discovering real-life quests: based on curated experiences in\nthe city\n> Everywhere quests that work in any city\n> Quest Filters: Adventure/Food/Nature,etc\n\n> After completing a quest:\ni. Claim the quest\nii. Give rating (1-5) star\niii Write reviews\niv. Upload photos\nv. Have a description: Story about the experience\n\n> Daily Mini Quests\n> Streaks, badges, habit systems\n> Bucket list and planning \n> Quest personality -> App derives personality from actions\n> Latest update: Create sidequests for the city\n\n>One line: gamified social journal for real-world experiences,\nwhere users discover activities, do them offline, document them,\nand build an identity/profile from lived experiences rather than\ncareer achievements.\n\n(Insanely strong)\n\nPick up:\n>Habit system\n>Filter quests\n>generate location based quests ?",
      "fontSize": 69,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "AjVdUKTJo21fxNjB6Q82S",
      "originalText": "1) SideQuest - Log your Lore\n\n> Released 15 March, '26\n> Intake on an invite basis (sign up and you are in the queue)\n> Discovering real-life quests: based on curated experiences in the city\n> Everywhere quests that work in any city\n> Quest Filters: Adventure/Food/Nature,etc\n\n> After completing a quest:\ni. Claim the quest\nii. Give rating (1-5) star\niii Write reviews\niv. Upload photos\nv. Have a description: Story about the experience\n\n> Daily Mini Quests\n> Streaks, badges, habit systems\n> Bucket list and planning \n> Quest personality -> App derives personality from actions\n> Latest update: Create sidequests for the city\n\n>One line: gamified social journal for real-world experiences, where users discover activities, do them offline, document them, and build an identity/profile from lived experiences rather than career achievements.\n\n(Insanely strong)\n\nPick up:\n>Habit system\n>Filter quests\n>generate location based quests ?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
