      "text": "> Vertical Scrolling: If I scroll up (previous day) then swipe to\nanother section (lets say tasks, what is the behaviour ?)\n\n? Soln : When scrolled past current day: Dont allow horizontal scroll\nwhen not on present date and also give a go to Present button ",
      "fontSize": 52,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "> Vertical Scrolling: If I scroll up (previous day) then swipe to another section (lets say tasks, what is the behaviour ?)\n\n? Soln : When scrolled past current day: Dont allow horizontal scroll when not on present date and also give a go to Present button ",
